4036235","verified_at":"2026-10-23T17:26:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3489340-1847286114032606","game_id":"steam-3489340","kind":"announcement","title":"Bug Fixes & Improvements","summary":"Hello everyone! We hope you've been enjoying the demo so far! With Steam Next Fest still underway, we've been working on fixing known bugs and making improvements to give you a smoother gameplay experience.Here's what's included in this update:Improved the Continue Game feature. Progress can now be saved in tutorial rooms as well.Fixed various UI elements extending beyond their intended boundaries.Improved the tutorial stages by making the melee counterattack tutorial requirements more forgiving","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T13:16:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032606","verified_at":"2026-10-22T14:20:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3489340-1847286114028186","game_id":"steam-3489340","kind":"announcement","title":"Bug Fixes & Improvements","summary":"Hello everyone!Steam Next Fest is in full swing! To improve your experience with the demo, we've been working on fixing known bugs and making gameplay adjustments.Here's what's included in this update:Fixed an issue where enemies would not spawn.Fixed an issue where exits would not trigger the transition to the next area.Adjusted the number of consecutive shots fired by the Crossbow Soldiers.Removed spike traps in front of certain treasure chests.Temporarily removed the Halberd Soldiers.If you h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:21:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028186","verified_at":"2026-10-21T11:12:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3489340-1846651706694053","game_id":"steam-3489340","kind":"announcement","title":"Feature Updates & Optimizations","summary":"Hello everyone!Steam Next Fest is in full swing! To make your experience with the demo even better, we've made a few improvements and fixes.Here's what's included in this update:Improved Continue Game Functionality – You can now resume your run and return to the combat room after exiting the game midway.Controller Improvements – Fixed and optimized various controller-related issues.We're still working on improving compatibility with different controllers. For the best experience we recommend usi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T07:25:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694053","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3489340-1846651706693364","game_id":"steam-3489340","kind":"announcement","title":"ReBlade: The Death Spiral Demo OUT NOW!","summary":"Greetings everyone!Since revealing ReBlade: The Death Spiral earlier this year, we've received so much support and interest from players around the world. Thank you to everyone who's been following our journey!We're a small team of eight developers from ChillyRoom, brought together by our love for action games. This is our first independent game, and while development has come with its challenges, we're excited to finally share a major milestone with you! Our very first public demo is NOW AVAILA","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T01:56:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693364","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3489340-1822556746168308","game_id":"steam-34893